    schema:description "<p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Join Our Global Recruitment Team as a Talent Acquisition Associate, EMEA, based out of Manchester. &nbsp;</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"416\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Guidepoint is expanding into <strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"322\">Manchester</strong>, and we're looking for a <strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"380\">Talent Acquisition Associate</strong> to help build our newest UK office.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"800\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This is a unique opportunity to play a key role in our growth, supporting end-to-end recruitment while helping establish Guidepoint's UK campus recruitment programme from the ground up. Working alongside our global Talent Acquisition team, you'll partner with hiring managers, build relationships with leading universities and help attract exceptional talent across the EMEA region.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"958\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This is a <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"847\">hybrid role based in Manchester</strong>. While our permanent office is being finalised, you'll initially work from a temporary workspace and remotely.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1013\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>All applicants must have the right to work in the UK.</strong></span></p> <h4 style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-section-id=\"v5cssg\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1032\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Your Role</span></h4> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1221\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As a Talent Acquisition Associate, you'll manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring while supporting the continued growth of Guidepoint's UK operations.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1536\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You'll partner with hiring managers to deliver recruitment strategies, build strong talent pipelines and provide an exceptional candidate experience. Alongside business-as-usual recruitment, you'll play a key role in developing our UK campus recruitment programme and representing Guidepoint at university events.</span></p> <h4 style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-section-id=\"11vcmyo\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1560\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">What You'll Do</span></h4> <ul data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"2152\"> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"avpotq\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1641\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"83uj6z\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1717\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Partner with hiring managers to deliver effective recruitment strategies.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"se7u3s\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1783\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Source and engage high-quality talent across multiple channels.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1p4jssp\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1868\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Build relationships with UK universities, careers teams and student organisations.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1sb5ibo\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1961\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Represent Guidepoint at careers fairs, networking events and employer branding activities.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1bpvpz9\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2040\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Manage candidate communications, interview coordination and offer processes.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"j87l8b\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2152\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Collaborate with the Global Talent Acquisition team to improve recruitment processes and share best practice.</span></li> </ul> <h4 style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-section-id=\"cubbob\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2179\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">What You'll Bring</span></h4> <ul data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2721\"> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1u6300l\" data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2226\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor's degree or equivalent experience.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"iombk6\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2298\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1–3 years' experience in full-cycle recruitment (agency or in-house).</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"26dnj\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2356\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"10h0h6g\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2438\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1iul394\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2510\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Experience sourcing and engaging candidates across multiple channels (LinkedIn Recruiter e.g.)</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"11xbd0n\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2578\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Proficiency with Applicant Tracking Systems and Microsoft Office.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"2dtbmh\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2721\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Ability to use AI-enabled tools thoughtfully and responsibly, with attention to accuracy, confidentiality, data quality and human judgement.</span></li> </ul> <h4 style=\"line-height: 1.4;\" data-section-id=\"12lll1\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2744\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">What We Offer</span></h4> <ul> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Competitive salary and bonus.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Excellent medical coverage through BUPA</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Professional development opportunities</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Supportive culture that celebrates and rewards success</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Informal work environment</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Employee Assistance Programs</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Volunteer days</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1ypf1c2\" data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2799\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Hybrid working.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1hr9wvq\" data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2878\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Opportunity to help launch Guidepoint's Manchester office and shape our UK campus recruitment programme</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"if6smq\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3014\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">International exposure within a global Talent Acquisition team.</span></li> <li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\" data-section-id=\"1662r9m\" data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3084\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Collaborative team environment and regular social events.</span></li> </ul> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>About Guidepoint:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Guidepoint powers end-to-end research workflows for the world’s best research teams.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Backed by a global network of more than<strong> 2 million experts and over 1,600 employees,</strong> Guidepoint delivers real-time access to expertise, primary research, and actionable knowledge that help organizations make informed decisions. Through consultations, surveys, events, proprietary content, and AI-enabled tools, we support every stage of the decision-making process—from developing hypotheses and gathering insights to validating assumptions and building conviction for critical decisions.</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At Guidepoint, our success relies on the diversity of our employees, experts, and clients, which enables us to foster meaningful connections and a broad range of perspectives. We are committed to creating an inclusive and welcoming environment where individuals of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences can contribute and succeed.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">#LI-HYBRID</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">#LI-DT1</span></p> <p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;</p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-guidepoint ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-associate-talent-acquisition-manchester-35436" ;
    schema:jobLocation [ a schema:Place ;
            schema:name "Manchester" ] ;
    schema:title "Associate, Talent Acquisition" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/guidepoint/associate-talent-acquisition-manchester-35436> .

