    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deliveroo/machine-learning-engineer-growth-personalisation-london-124862> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-machine-learning-engineer-routing-eta-london-5454> a prov:Entity,
