            schema:name "Munich Office" ] ;
    schema:title "Principal Business Development Collection Expansion (m/f/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/westwing-group-se/principal-business-development-collection-expansion-munich-office-392806> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-principal-engineer-product-security-berlin-442587> a prov:Entity,
