    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/deliveroo/strategy-operations-manager-emerging-fraud-abuse-london-101573> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-strategy-operations-manager-payments-risk-fraud-london-495924> a prov:Entity,
